29:T3e36,<h2><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6867 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/image-7-e1719840041465.png" alt="" width="708" height="584" /></h2>
<h2>Introduction</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The realm of advertising is dynamic and progressive, impacting a consumer&#8217;s mindset and buying decisions. With current preceding times, consumers demand more transparency and awareness with relevant information, honest advertising, and relevance of the brand’s message or product’s claim in their advertising. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">That being said, advertisers are now expected to be more transparent when advertising their products or services. The latest concerns arose amidst the recent Patanjali’s controversy and ongoing case over false medical claims and misleading advertisements about their brand. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The </span><a href="https://lawbeat.in/supreme-court-updates/centre-mandates-self-declaration-certificate-advertisers-june-18-after"><span data-contrast="none">supreme court on 7</span><span data-contrast="none">th</span><span data-contrast="none"> May, 2024</span></a>,<span data-contrast="auto"> issued a mandatory Self-declaration certificate that is a must for all advertisers or advertising agencies claiming the authenticity of your advertisement.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Everything You Need to Know About: New Self-Declaration Certificate</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">You might have already heard about the “Self-declaration certificate” that must be issued by advertisers/ <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">advertising agencies</a> effective 18</span><span data-contrast="auto">th</span><span data-contrast="auto"> June 2024. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The initiative is designed to curb issues like misleading and false advertisements. It is a mandate for various advertisement mediums and requires submission on the following portals accordingly.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Broadcast Seva portal for </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">TV, Radio ads</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Press Council of India’s portal for </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">Print</span><span data-contrast="auto">, Digital Media ads.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/native-advertising-for-your-brand/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Native Advertising – A new way for people to discover your brand</a></p>
<h2><strong>How to Apply for the Self Declaration Form: Here’s a Comprehensive Step by Step Guide  </strong></h2>
<p>1: Create a letter for Authorization.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6866 size-medium" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/image-6-300x223.png" alt="" width="300" height="223" /></p>
<p>2: Letter of Authorization digital copy with the signature and company seal.</p>
<p>3: Apply for Authorization (Registration process)<br />
<span data-contrast="auto">on https: </span><a href="https://cbcindia.gov.in/cbc/advt-reg"><span data-contrast="none">https://cbcindia.gov.in/cbc/advt-reg</span></a><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6867 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/image-7-1024x444.png" alt="" width="660" height="286" /></p>
<p>4: Next is a two-step verification, you will receive an OTP on your mobile number and E-mail address.</p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">5: Post this step you will receive a password on your mail sent by the press council.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">6: You will see page like this </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6868 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/image-8-1024x577.png" alt="" width="660" height="372" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Click on the 1</span><span data-contrast="auto">st</span><span data-contrast="auto"> option – Generate Self declaration Certificate </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">7: In the next step fill in the details required.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6869 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/image-9-1024x586.png" alt="" width="660" height="378" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Here you need to generate the self-certificate which requires you to fill up the following details like: </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Product name-</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Title of the advertisement-</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">First release date of the advertisement-</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Upload the ad in pdf-</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Brief description of the ad in max 200 characters- Explaining the ads purpose.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">8: Post uploading the pdf then download the document that is auto generated (ref to the picture below)</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6870 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/image-10-1024x551.png" alt="" width="660" height="355" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">9: Add your companies&#8217; signature/seal on it. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">10: Then reupload the signed document in the 2</span><span data-contrast="auto">nd</span><span data-contrast="auto"> column (Light Blue) </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">11: If you wish to recheck the document, you can view it from the 3rd Column View.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">12: There you have your self- declaration form applied.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Potential benefits as a Consumer:</h2>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="auto">More trust &amp; Accountability </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="auto">Enhanced Transparency about the brand and product</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="auto">No fake or unreal claims</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/did-you-know-customer-experiences-is-the-new-marketing-tool/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Did You Know? Customer Experience Is The New Marketing Tool</a></p>
<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Advertising is a foremost field that is bound to update and develop with changing times with every digital progress. However, we will keep you updated about more such updates in the digital world and discover and explore them. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Reach out to </span><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/digital-marketing-agency-in-thane"><b><span data-contrast="none">Impulse Digital- Digital Marketing Agency in Thane</span></b></a><span data-contrast="auto">, and ease your advertising journey with the latest updates, well-planned strategies, creative campaigns, and elevate your advertising journey to the next level with us. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
